              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ak04"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a really good starting point. I didnt measure anything. I used my judgement as to how much I wanted of each spice and went from there. It turned out great! I used it as a rub for some gyros and it was delicious. I still have some left over to use again."
          },
          {
