              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good flavor, but I’ll definitely play around with the amounts next time. I found the cinnamon and nutmeg to be overpowering so I’d definitely cut those in half. So far I’ve tried this on grilled chicken and pork chops, but it would also make great kabobs or grilled veggies.",
